      "One75ms pre-RTP admission hold per episode; duplicate/new reports cannot extend it and expiry invents no ACK",
      "A normal fast link has no short-signal pressure; sufficient short severe evidence precedes100ms confirmation in the deterministic serialized-link regression"
    ]
