  "implemented": [
    "Private source feature16 and server-only input opcode15 carry a path rate and64-bit token. Worker applies the new cropped target before marking a fresh independent picture; each local AU keeps its actual token and configured codec target across delayed output/rate resets. Normal old-worker output is unchanged until the explicit command.",
    "Host credit/admission wait now precedes RTP sequence/history/counter assignment. A confirmed refresh retires only uncommitted dependent work; an already-dispatched fragmented AU finishes. Authentication and complete-frame image/layout ACKs remain independent.",
    "Explicit confirmed decrease honors any needed cropped codec reduction while preserving the reset quiet period; ordinary estimate dwell, full-desktop quality, caps and actual byte debt remain. A request persists until its target is applied or full-desktop fallback is selected.",
    "Matched25ms/3450B packet pressure may hold the next uncommitted AU for75ms once per congestion episode. It cannot change codec rate, pacing target, packet credit or guest input. A confirmed cut releases it; a fresh low-queue interval rearms it."
  ],
